# Scratchpad (ephemeral working area) — no ignore lines here: `.gitignore:16`
# (`/dev`) already excludes the whole governance tree, and git cannot re-include
# a path below an excluded parent, so the former `dev/scratchpad/*` +
# `!dev/scratchpad/.gitkeep` pair was inert (FID-2026-1016-011). The scratchpad's
# real guard is its 24 h lifecycle (common/src/util/scratchpad.ts) plus the
# root-shape rule in scripts/hygiene.ts.

# Free-compute discovery pipeline artifacts (FID-2026-0914-003): daily
# harvest report + candidate state + agent-context sidecars — regenerated
# in place by every run, never source.
dev/provider-candidates/
# Provider identity gauntlet reports (FID-2026-1007-008) — regenerated fresh on
# every operator run, replace-in-place, never committed.
dev/provider-identity/
# Model-compliance telemetry (FID-2026-1007-012): compliance.jsonl is tracked
# source data (churn-committed like raw-traces); drift runs and proposal
# drafts are derived/local review surface, regenerated in place, never
# committed.
dev/telemetry/*
!dev/telemetry/compliance.jsonl

